  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You gain a +1 bonus to saving throws against planar environmental effects from any plane that is not your own, including those that enter your plane like the Radia’s storm effects. In Hyraeatan, you may (if you wish) consider Radia storm conditions as on level lower in intensity while in the City. Level 1 intensity Radia effects do not require you to make saving throws.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/seraph-feats#toc36\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
